msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/propagated-noise-absorption/extracted-outputs/8c9afe5e-6fa3-427d-a672-becdb14490b8-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Twirl the two-qubit gate layers and measurements, and find unique layers {#twirl-the-two-qubit-gate-layers-and-measurements-and-find-unique-layers}"
msgstr "Twirl lapisan two-qubit gate dan pengukuran, serta temukan lapisan unik {#twirl-the-two-qubit-gate-layers-and-measurements-and-find-unique-layers}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We use `samplomatic` to box the circuit and identify unique two-qubit layers. A box is a construct that groups instructions together so that specific intents or annotations can later be applied uniformly to all gates within the same box.\n"
msgstr "Kita menggunakan `samplomatic` untuk mem-box circuit dan mengidentifikasi lapisan two-qubit yang unik. Box adalah sebuah konstruk yang mengelompokkan instruksi bersama-sama sehingga intent atau anotasi tertentu dapat kemudian diterapkan secara seragam ke semua gate dalam box yang sama.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here, we call the method `generate_boxing_pass_manager`, which goes beyond simply identifying two-qubit layers. It performs several key tasks:\n"
msgstr "Di sini, kita memanggil metode `generate_boxing_pass_manager`, yang melakukan lebih dari sekadar mengidentifikasi lapisan two-qubit. Metode ini melakukan beberapa tugas utama:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Groups all two-qubit layers in the circuit,\n"
msgstr "Mengelompokkan semua lapisan two-qubit dalam circuit,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Applies the `Twirl` and `ChangeBasis` annotations to those layers,\n"
msgstr "Menerapkan anotasi `Twirl` dan `ChangeBasis` pada lapisan-lapisan tersebut,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Groups measurement operations into their own boxed sections, and\n"
msgstr "Mengelompokkan operasi pengukuran ke dalam bagian boxed-nya sendiri, dan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Applies the `InjectNoise` annotation to each two-qubit layer.\n"
msgstr "Menerapkan anotasi `InjectNoise` pada setiap lapisan two-qubit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These annotations define how noise, basis changes, and twirling are handled throughout the circuit. They also establish the structure used later for learning and mitigating noise.\n"
msgstr "Anotasi ini mendefinisikan bagaimana noise, perubahan basis, dan twirling ditangani di seluruh circuit. Anotasi ini juga menetapkan struktur yang digunakan nanti untuk mempelajari dan memitigasi noise.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The key configuration options are:\n"
msgstr "Opsi konfigurasi utama adalah:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`enable_gates`/`enable_measures: True`: Box all two-qubit gate layers and terminal measurements. Single-qubit gates are left-dressed within the boxes.\n"
msgstr "`enable_gates`/`enable_measures: True`: Mem-box semua lapisan two-qubit gate dan pengukuran terminal. Single-qubit gate di-left-dressed di dalam box.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`measure_annotations: all`: Include `Twirl` and `ChangeBasis` annotations on the measurement box.\n"
msgstr "`measure_annotations: all`: Menyertakan anotasi `Twirl` dan `ChangeBasis` pada box pengukuran.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`twirling_strategy: active`: Twirl all active qubits in each box containing entangling gates.\n"
msgstr "`twirling_strategy: active`: Meng-twirl semua qubit aktif dalam setiap box yang berisi entangling gate.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`inject_noise_targets: gates`: Add `InjectNoise` annotations to all `Twirl`-annotated boxes containing entangling gates.\n"
msgstr "`inject_noise_targets: gates`: Menambahkan anotasi `InjectNoise` pada semua box yang beranotasi `Twirl` yang berisi entangling gate.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`inject_noise_strategy: uniform_modification`: Scale all noise layers equivalently across the circuit.\n"
msgstr "`inject_noise_strategy: uniform_modification`: Menskalakan semua lapisan noise secara setara di seluruh circuit.\n"

